<body class=".homeLayout" style="background-color: #46568b; ">

<div class="container text-center" style="width: 100%; height: 100vh;">
  <img src="<%= image_url("home_screen_bg.png") %>" style="width: 75%; height: 380px; margin-top: 25px">


  <h2 style="font-family: 'Bree Serif', serif;width: 50%;
      color: #93c178;
      margin: 20px auto;">Scalable & Intelligent <br>Expense Management System</h2>
  <p style="width: 50%;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 15px auto;
  ">Simplify expense management and payables processing so you can focus on the important things — like growing your
    business!.</p>
</div>

<div class="row" id="featuresDiv" style="background-color: white;padding-top: 50px;padding-bottom: 50px">

  <h3 style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 50px">Features & Benefits</h3>

  <div class="row" style="padding-left: 150px;padding-right: 150px">
    <section class="col-md-1"><img src="<%= image_url('report_feature.png') %>"></section>

    <section class="col-md-5">
      <h5>Report Faster</h5>
      <hr>
      <p>Employees can generate expense reports on the fly for the expenses incurred, have them reviewed by their
        manager and claim reimbursements 10x faster than traditional process.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="col-md-1"><img src="<%= image_url('workflow_feature.png') %>"></section>

    <section class="col-md-5">

      <h5>Streamline Your Workflow</h5>
      <hr>
      <p>Design a multi-level approval workflow to meet your organization’s needs. Approval workflow gives our clients
        the
        opportunity to set defined approval paths with various routing rules including approval limits and special
        approval rules. </p></section>
  </div>
  <div class="row" style="padding-left: 150px;padding-right: 150px">
    <section class="col-md-1"><img src="<%= image_url('policy_feature.png') %>"></section>

    <section class="col-md-5">
      <h5>Policy Compliance</h5>
      <hr>
      <p>Gives you the flexibility to set expense reporting compliance rules and enforce your own spending policies.
        Spending limits and expense policies are built right into the system, so your employees will know immediately
        when
        an expense report falls outside company policy.</p></section>
    <section class="col-md-1"><img src="<%= image_url('sync_feature.png') %>"></section>

    <section class="col-md-5">
      <h5>Account Sync</h5>
      <hr>
      <p>Integrates with your accounting system, allowing you to cut time spent on data entry and easily export the
        data
        you need, be it in excel or in PDF format.</p></section>
  </div>
  <div class="row" style="padding-left: 150px;padding-right: 150px">
    <section class="col-md-1"><img src="<%= image_url('analyze_feature.png') %>"></section>

    <section class="col-md-5">
      <h5>Analyze</h5>
      <hr>
      <p>Analyze overall expense spending for opportunities to reduce costs and get better insight into company's
        spend.</p></section>
    <section class="col-md-1"><img src="<%= image_url('mobile_feature.png') %>"></section>

    <section class="col-md-5">
      <h5>Mobile</h5>
      <hr>
      <p>Never lose a receipt again! Snap pictures of receipts on the go
        Create and submit expense reports from your phone
        Free mobile app for Android</p></section>
  </div>

</div>

