    <h1 style="font-size: 55px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: 'Bree Serif', serif">Finly</h1>

    <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 300"> You Spend, We Manage.</p>-->

<div style="text-align: center;">
  <p style="color: white;
